Z||000009||KnightRyder31||04-19-2001||12:45 PM||||Thank you FirstFiero!<BR>I agree with you totally!!!<BR>Morrison is my favorite modern-day poet.<BR>He was a genius! I don't really have a favorite song though, I seem to like all of them. The End, Unknown Soldier, L.A. Woman, Strange Days, Roadhouse Blues, Moonlight Drive, Wild Child, Alabama Song(Whisky Bar), Spanish Caravan, 5 to 1, and of course Riders on the Storm are just SOME of my favorites.<BR>I am currently reading all of the books about the Doors and Morrison(Strange Days, Riders on the Storm, No One Here Gets Out Alive, Lizard King) and I am reading Morrison's Poetry book, An American Prayer.<BR>Also from what the book Strange Days says; the movie the Doors was not very accurate.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by KnightRyder31 (edited 04-19-2001).]||||reg||1
